---
source: crates/monarch-tui/src/widgets/help_view.rs
expression: "draw(&state, 70, 10).join(\"\\n\")"
---
┌ help · keys follow ctrl+b ─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Panes                                                              │
│   " -        split the pane top and bottom                         │
│   % |        split the pane side by side                           │
│   x          close the pane                                        │
│   z          zoom the pane to fill the tab, or unzoom              │
│   hjkl ←↓↑→  focus the pane in that direction                      │
│   o          focus the next pane                                   │
│   {          swap with the previous pane                           │
└ 1–8 of 60 · type to search · ↑↓ PgUp PgDn scroll · esc close ──────┘
